                                "sense_id": "9240856b-fb39-3a7c-969b-bc2e3b37f994",
                                "text": "De erfenis werd verdeeld tussen de echtelijke bezittingen en persoonlijke bezittingen.",
                                "translation": "The inheritance was divided between the matrimonial properties and personal belongings.",
                                "english": "The inheritance was divided between the matrimonial properties and personal belongings."
                            },
